WEBVTT

asr-000022
00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:59.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: Budget briefing on the fiscal year 2027, proposed budget by the my most beloved agency, Technical Education and Skills Development Authority, or TESDA.

asr-000024
00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:16.920
Senator Joel Villanueva: Now, hereby called to order, we would like to acknowledge the entire TESDA family headed by our good friend, former Commissioner of ETCOM, Secretary Kiko Benitez.

asr-000025
00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:34.380
Senator Joel Villanueva: We would also acknowledge our DDGs. Hindi ko na ho kayo iisa-isahin. And of course, our friends from COA, the entire TESDA family. Magandang hapon po sa inyong lahat.

asr-000026
00:10:34.380 --> 00:10:46.740
Senator Joel Villanueva: So let me start by commending all of you for your service to our country and our people. Such a great honor and privilege.

asr-000027
00:10:46.920 --> 00:10:57.620
Senator Joel Villanueva: Na naging part po ako ng TESDA. At hanggang ngayon, I go with the TESDA man moniker. At muli ho, magandang hapon sa inyong lahat.

asr-000028
00:10:57.620 --> 00:11:16.900
Senator Joel Villanueva: TESDA has always held a special place in my heart bilang dating hepe ng TESDA. Personal po sa atin ang mission na bigyan ang bawat Pilipino ng kasanayan at pagkakataon na magkaroon ng marangal na trabaho at mas magandang buhay.

asr-000029
00:11:16.920 --> 00:11:29.180
Senator Joel Villanueva: Mas magandang kinabukasan. Sa likod po ng bawat TESDA scholarship na very famous, very popular, ay isang kabataan na naghahanap ng kanyang unang trabaho.

asr-000030
00:11:29.780 --> 00:11:42.320
Senator Joel Villanueva: Isa pong magulang na nagnanais madagdagan ang kita ng kanilang pamilya o isang manggagawang kailangan mag-upskill upang hindi po maiwan ng nagbabagong ekonomiya.

asr-000031
00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:46.880
Senator Joel Villanueva: In 2026, TESDA received its largest budget on record.

asr-000032
00:11:46.920 --> 00:12:05.980
Senator Joel Villanueva: But its current budget is only 2.2% of the total education budget. Laging sinasabi, ang TESDA ay partin ng tinatawag na trinity doon sa trifocalized education with the Department of Education and the Commission on Higher Education.

asr-000033
00:12:05.980 --> 00:12:14.680
Senator Joel Villanueva: At gaya ng trinity sa isang pananampalataya, yung TESDA daw yung tumatay yung Holy Spirit.

asr-000034
00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:16.480
Senator Joel Villanueva: Napakahalaga.

asr-000035
00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:17.780
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pero ang hirap intindihin.

asr-000036
00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:31.300
Senator Joel Villanueva: For 2027, TESDA is proposing a budget of 21.20 billion, 5.15 billion or 19.5% lower than its 2026 budget.

asr-000037
00:12:31.300 --> 00:12:36.300
Senator Joel Villanueva: Now, of this amount, 20.48 billion is intended for operations.

asr-000038
00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:44.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: Direct program allocations include 19.66 billion for the Technical Education Skills Development Program.

asr-000039
00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:53.780
Senator Joel Villanueva: 497.6 million for the Regulatory Program and 40.1 million for the Policy Program.

asr-000040
00:12:53.780 --> 00:13:05.540
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sa bawat isang daang piso sa panukala ng budget ng TESDA, halos 93 pesos ang nakalaan sa Core Technical Education and Skills Development Program,

asr-000041
00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:10.860
Senator Joel Villanueva: which covers scholarships, training, and other skills development interventions.

asr-000042
00:13:10.860 --> 00:13:14.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: Now, with fewer resources and continuing demand for training,

asr-000043
00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:19.940
Senator Joel Villanueva: every peso must work harder and reach those who need it most.

asr-000044
00:13:20.340 --> 00:13:23.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: But a scholarship slot alone is not success.

asr-000045
00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:29.720
Senator Joel Villanueva: A TESDA scholarship must be a complete pathway from enrollment and quality training

asr-000046
00:13:29.720 --> 00:13:35.040
Senator Joel Villanueva: to assessment, certification, and ultimately decent work for a sustainable livelihood.

asr-000047
00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:37.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ngayong pong araw, nais po nating malaman.

asr-000048
00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:43.020
Senator Joel Villanueva: Nakakarating po ba ang mga scholarships sa mahihirap at underserved communities?

asr-000049
00:13:43.020 --> 00:14:02.980
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ang mga kursong pinupondohan ba natin ay talagang kailangan ng industriya? Nakapagtatapos nga po ba na-assess at nasa-certify ang ating mga scholar at ating mga kliyente? At nagkakaroon po ba sila ng trabaho angkop sa kanilang natututunan?

asr-000050
00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:18.960
Senator Joel Villanueva: We also want TESDA scholarships to prepare Filipinos for the future through higher qualifications, micro-credentials, digital and AI skills, enterprise-based training, and clear pathways for continuous learning and career advancement.

asr-000051
00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:32.120
Senator Joel Villanueva: TESDA is seeking additional funding for more than 162,000 beneficiaries. And of course, as always, we are here ready to support resources that will genuinely expand opportunity.

asr-000052
00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:45.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: But expansion must be matched also by implementation capacity, transparency, timely fund utilization, and measurable employment outcomes. Our purpose is very clear.

asr-000053
00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:54.360
Senator Joel Villanueva: We wanted to strengthen TESDA and its programs, but also ensure that every scholarship delivers on its promise to the Filipino people.

asr-000054
00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:59.980
Senator Joel Villanueva: Having said that, we look forward to a fruitful discussion on this proposed 2027

asr-000055
