01:33:12.660 --> 01:33:18.160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Maaring mas marami pa tayong mapapadala sa ibang bansa na makapag-trabaho

asr-001785
01:33:18.160 --> 01:33:21.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: at makapagbigay po ng suporta sa kanilang pangalaman.

asr-001786
01:33:21.720 --> 01:33:23.180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pamilya, once they're employed.

asr-001787
01:33:23.840 --> 01:33:25.400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Marami po tayong mga skilled workers.

asr-001788
01:33:25.660 --> 01:33:31.560
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hindi lang po dito sa Luzon, kundi sa Visayas at Mindanao

asr-001789
01:33:31.560 --> 01:33:33.580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: na gusto pong mag-trabaho.

asr-001790
01:33:33.720 --> 01:33:40.100
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Maaring hindi nila alam saan sila humingi ng tulong at magkakaroon po ng trabaho.

asr-001791
01:33:40.720 --> 01:33:46.920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mas makakatulong pa yun sa ating to reduce the unemployment rate natin.

asr-001792
01:33:48.860 --> 01:33:50.160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Importante po ang TESDA.

asr-001793
01:33:50.480 --> 01:33:51.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: This agency plays a role.

asr-001794
01:33:51.660 --> 01:33:56.520
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: A vital role in enhancing the skills of our Filipino workers

asr-001795
01:33:56.520 --> 01:34:00.540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: and providing them with better opportunities for employment and livelihood.

asr-001796
01:34:01.260 --> 01:34:03.440
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nabanggit po ito ng Presidente sa kanyang SONA,

asr-001797
01:34:03.680 --> 01:34:08.200
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Technical and Vocational Education and Training, or TVET,

asr-001798
01:34:09.020 --> 01:34:11.320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: is an effective tool for success.

asr-001799
01:34:11.500 --> 01:34:16.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kaya naman po, at the time when competition in the labor market is increasingly intense,

asr-001800
01:34:16.720 --> 01:34:21.580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: it is crucial that we equip our people with the necessary skills to keep pace with the rapid,

asr-001801
01:34:21.660 --> 01:34:26.540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ever-changing changes in various industries, not only locally but globally as well.

asr-001802
01:34:26.940 --> 01:34:32.020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Through TESDA, libo-libong Pilipino po ang nabibigyan ng pagkakataong magkaroon ng sapat na kasanayan

asr-001803
01:34:32.020 --> 01:34:38.040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: sa iba't ibang larangan mula sa healthcare, agriculture, construction at hospitality

asr-001804
01:34:38.040 --> 01:34:41.420
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: hanggang sa information technology at marami pang iba.

asr-001805
01:34:42.220 --> 01:34:48.400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pero yung napaka-importante nito, yung catchword talaga ngayon is TESDA.

asr-001806
01:34:48.400 --> 01:34:49.940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung mga programa ninyo.

asr-001807
01:34:49.940 --> 01:34:54.580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Na saan nila pwedeng i-avail, saan sila lalapit,

asr-001808
01:34:54.740 --> 01:34:59.840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: maaaring just increase your information campaign.

asr-001809
01:35:00.160 --> 01:35:06.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At the same time, increase your utilization sa inyong budget.

asr-001810
01:35:06.820 --> 01:35:10.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ang mga programs nyo po ay isang mahalagang susi po para sa ating mga kababayan

asr-001811
01:35:10.720 --> 01:35:15.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: na nagnanais magkaroon ng mas maayos na trabaho, mas matatag na kabuhayan,

asr-001812
01:35:15.380 --> 01:35:17.760
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: at mas magandang buhay.

asr-001813
01:35:18.220 --> 01:35:19.760
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Lalo na po sa mga Pilipino.

asr-001814
01:35:19.940 --> 01:35:22.240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hindi nabigyan ng pagkakataong makapagkolehyo.

asr-001815
01:35:23.460 --> 01:35:27.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mahalaga pong malaman nila na may iba pang landas tungo sa tagumpay.

asr-001816
01:35:28.180 --> 01:35:33.840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sa pamamagitan po ng TESDA, maaaring silang matuto ng mga kasanayang kinakailangan sa industriya

asr-001817
01:35:33.840 --> 01:35:40.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: at makakuha ng national certificate na magiging tulay nila upang magkaroon ng mas maraming oportunidad

asr-001818
01:35:40.500 --> 01:35:42.120
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: para sa trabaho at pagunlan.

asr-001819
01:35:42.120 --> 01:35:47.320
