asr-001822
01:36:06.000 --> 01:36:09.960
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: TESDA programs change lives.

asr-001823
01:36:09.960 --> 01:36:16.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: They open doors, create opportunities, and empower many Filipinos to build a better future for themselves

asr-001824
01:36:16.680 --> 01:36:18.120
