TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: and amendments na ginagawa ngayon. LUC charter amendments, as well as the construction of the regional training innovation centers, sir.

asr-002295
02:05:46.100 --> 02:05:51.620
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: But I am constrained or we are constrained in terms of TESDA.

asr-002296
02:05:51.620 --> 02:05:57.620
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Kagaya po na nabanggit ko kanina, we've proposed our right-sizing optimization process.

asr-002297
02:05:58.280 --> 02:06:02.180
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Yes, to DBM and it's undergoing study by the DBM.

asr-002298
02:06:02.880 --> 02:06:08.920
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Because hindi po nagpapalit, as you know, ang ating staffing pattern.

asr-002299
02:06:09.040 --> 02:06:15.380
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Halimbawa, sa tasks natin, sa ating mga provincial training centers, kulang po tayo ng tao.

asr-002300
02:06:15.960 --> 02:06:20.960
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: At hindi po regularized ang ating mga trainers and assessors.

asr-002301
02:06:21.480 --> 02:06:27.540
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Marami po sa kanila ay part-time lang kasi wala naman pong plantilia position.

asr-002302
02:06:27.540 --> 02:06:42.200
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: And they are treated like seasonal workers, seasonal employees, rather than, for example, in longer-term diploma programs that are regular in terms of the school year, in terms of its delivery.

asr-002303
02:06:42.680 --> 02:06:45.620
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: So may mga ganun pong issues pa on the ground.

asr-002304
02:06:46.260 --> 02:06:53.760
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: And to be frank, to be frank, that also affects the efficiency by which we can disperse.

asr-002305
02:06:53.760 --> 02:06:57.520
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: So, konektado po sa totoo lang lahat.

asr-002306
02:06:57.540 --> 02:07:13.480
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: So ngayon ko nalang sasabihin, Mr. Chair, I look forward to hearing the bill that you have filed for the departmentalization of TESDA para naman mapabilis at maayos itong mga issues namin.

asr-002307
02:07:14.420 --> 02:07:16.500
Senator Joel Villanueva: Siguro pag-usapan natin on another.

asr-002308
02:07:17.300 --> 02:07:21.020
Senator Joel Villanueva: I have so much things on my mind.

asr-002309
02:07:21.100 --> 02:07:22.060
Senator Joel Villanueva: I couldn't even start.

asr-002310
02:07:22.060 --> 02:07:24.700
Senator Joel Villanueva: Actually, mayroon akong briefer dito.

asr-002311
02:07:24.880 --> 02:07:26.480
Senator Joel Villanueva: But rambulan ako.

asr-002312
02:07:26.580 --> 02:07:27.520
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ano yung pumasok sa ito?

asr-002313
02:07:27.540 --> 02:07:31.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: And it's good that we talk about itong devolution.

asr-002314
02:07:31.460 --> 02:07:39.540
Senator Joel Villanueva: I think, kanina binabanggit ko kay Edie Carol, yung time ko sa TESDA, nakadalawa lang ako.

asr-002315
02:07:40.620 --> 02:07:43.280
Senator Joel Villanueva: And I felt na parang hindi ko magawa.

asr-002316
02:07:43.740 --> 02:07:50.120
Senator Joel Villanueva: I don't know how many na ngayon, the past years, hanggang ngayon, hanggang ngayon wala pa rin.

asr-002317
02:07:50.380 --> 02:07:54.300
Senator Joel Villanueva: And I have to say this, Edie Carol, I have to say this.

asr-002318
02:07:54.300 --> 02:07:57.340
Senator Joel Villanueva: In the Committee on Higher and Technical Education,

asr-002319
02:07:57.540 --> 02:07:58.160
Senator Joel Villanueva: here in the Senate,

asr-002320
02:07:58.320 --> 02:08:01.800
Senator Joel Villanueva: I get like 50-60 bills, Secretary.

asr-002321
02:08:02.420 --> 02:08:08.060
Senator Joel Villanueva: 50-60 bills for different districts and communities

asr-002322
02:08:08.060 --> 02:08:11.140
Senator Joel Villanueva: trying to put up their own TESDA center.

asr-002323
02:08:11.740 --> 02:08:14.260
Senator Joel Villanueva: And pag tinigil mo yung funding,

asr-002324
02:08:14.400 --> 02:08:18.180
Senator Joel Villanueva: they would ask the GAA and TESDA to provide the funds.

asr-002325
02:08:18.420 --> 02:08:19.520
Senator Joel Villanueva: Wala hong po kaming funds.

asr-002326
02:08:19.520 --> 02:08:27.320
Senator Joel Villanueva: I hope, I mean, you have to give your position na you can let them do it.

asr-002327
02:08:27.320 --> 02:08:33.700
Senator Joel Villanueva: But good luck kung willing kayong mag-fund noong mga ito.

asr-002328
02:08:33.780 --> 02:08:36.340
Senator Joel Villanueva: There are about 60 plus bills.

asr-002329
02:08:36.840 --> 02:08:43.240
Senator Joel Villanueva: And even during my time, I used to head the Committee on Higher and Technical Education

asr-002330
02:08:43.240 --> 02:08:44.380
Senator Joel Villanueva: here in the Senate.

asr-002331
02:08:44.760 --> 02:08:45.900
Senator Joel Villanueva: Wala akong pinasa kahit isa.

asr-002332
02:08:46.580 --> 02:08:47.460
Senator Joel Villanueva: Wala akong pinasa.

asr-002333
02:08:48.240 --> 02:08:55.080
Senator Joel Villanueva: So with that, I hope yung position ng TESDA would be firm.

asr-002334
02:08:55.440 --> 02:08:57.200
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kasi ang akala nila, sa akin lang.

asr-002335
02:08:57.200 --> 02:08:58.440
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kung nanggagaling yung gano'ng position.

asr-002336
02:08:58.600 --> 02:09:02.020
Senator Joel Villanueva: And my position is based on my own personal experience.

asr-002337
02:09:02.920 --> 02:09:08.780
Senator Joel Villanueva: So with this, I hope maging firm yung position din natin.

asr-002338
02:09:08.860 --> 02:09:11.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kasi if we're going to put up a new TESDA center,

asr-002339
02:09:11.740 --> 02:09:13.740
Senator Joel Villanueva: yeah, okay, fine, gusto natin yan.

asr-002340
02:09:14.480 --> 02:09:16.940
Senator Joel Villanueva: But klaro kung saan manggagaling yung pondo.

asr-002341
02:09:17.860 --> 02:09:19.600
Senator Joel Villanueva: Klaro kung sino magsusustain nito.

asr-002342
02:09:19.720 --> 02:09:24.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: Klaro na merong available assessors, teachers, etc.

asr-002343
02:09:24.460 --> 02:09:26.480
Senator Joel Villanueva: Because later on, I will go to that.

asr-002344
02:09:27.200 --> 02:09:35.140
Senator Joel Villanueva: So yung shortages natin sa mga assessors natin and the teachers.

asr-002345
02:09:39.340 --> 02:09:43.960
Senator Joel Villanueva: Can we hear si ED Carol about yung CLUCs?

asr-002346
02:09:44.000 --> 02:09:44.560
Senator Joel Villanueva: Isa pa yun eh.

asr-002347
02:09:44.800 --> 02:09:45.700
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: Yes, sir.

asr-002348
02:09:47.980 --> 02:09:48.940
Senator Joel Villanueva: Nagkakatinginan pa lang tayo.

asr-002349
02:09:49.040 --> 02:09:51.320
Senator Joel Villanueva: Alam na natin yung problema, sekretary eh.

asr-002350
02:09:51.680 --> 02:09:54.220
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: Mr. Chair, just to share in our studies,

asr-002351
02:09:54.600 --> 02:09:56.940
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: before siguro mga 10 years ago,

asr-002352
02:09:56.940 --> 02:09:59.320
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: there was just 20 recognized LUCs.

asr-002353
02:09:59.580 --> 02:10:01.240
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: Now there are 113.

asr-002354
02:10:01.760 --> 02:10:05.100
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: And more and more are applying to establish by law.

asr-002355
02:10:05.520 --> 02:10:07.940
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: And the challenge po to that is when you look at their finances,

asr-002356
02:10:09.080 --> 02:10:11.160
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: itatayo nila sa start.

asr-002357
02:10:11.680 --> 02:10:13.280
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: Pero lahat ng susunod na gastos,

asr-002358
02:10:13.380 --> 02:10:16.800
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: naka-charge against national government through free higher education.

asr-002359
02:10:17.000 --> 02:10:22.760
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: So ang nangyayari, mas dependent pa sila sa FHE kaysa SUCs.

asr-002360
02:10:23.140 --> 02:10:25.200
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: Kasi talagang totally dependent.

asr-002361
02:10:25.200 --> 02:10:26.900
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: And bigla nang nagpo-pull out.

asr-002362
02:10:26.940 --> 02:10:31.940
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: Nang funding mismo yung LGU when it comes to the sustaining of the LUCs.

asr-002363
02:10:32.780 --> 02:10:36.440
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: And CHED has admitted in many of our technical working groups, sir,

asr-002364
02:10:36.820 --> 02:10:40.200
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: in the committee, na talagang hindi na kaya nilang i-check yun.

asr-002365
02:10:40.280 --> 02:10:42.940
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: Kasi ang hingin lang nila, five-year institutional plan,

asr-002366
02:10:43.220 --> 02:10:46.160
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: certification that you have the resources to fund,

asr-002367
02:10:46.260 --> 02:10:47.300
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: syempre they will certify.

asr-002368
02:10:47.680 --> 02:10:49.580
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: But actually, do they fund eventually?

asr-002369
02:10:50.040 --> 02:10:51.320
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: Hindi po talagang nangyayari.

asr-002370
02:10:51.420 --> 02:10:54.640
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: Which is why the LUC governance bill that is in the committee now

asr-002371
02:10:54.640 --> 02:10:55.580
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: will really play a

asr-002372
02:10:55.580 --> 02:10:56.580
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: significant role

asr-002375
02:10:56.680 --> 02:10:59.960
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: in clarifying the responsibilities

asr-002376
02:10:59.960 --> 02:11:03.240
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: and making sure that hindi nagpo-pull out si LGU.

asr-002377
02:11:03.620 --> 02:11:06.860
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: Dapat, counterpart, LGU is still funding,

asr-002378
02:11:07.180 --> 02:11:10.360
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: but the national government will still support through FHE.

asr-002379
02:11:10.800 --> 02:11:15.240
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: Pero hindi pwedeng pull out, tapos bahala na si NGA at si GAA

asr-002380
02:11:15.240 --> 02:11:17.000
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: sa lahat ng funding ng LUCs.

asr-002381
02:11:17.060 --> 02:11:20.160
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: Kasi talagang hindi po natin kakayanin yung lobo na

asr-002382
02:11:20.160 --> 02:11:22.600
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: lahat, inasa lahat sa national government.

asr-002383
02:11:23.000 --> 02:11:26.120
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: Tapos biglang, by the second year, wala nang pinupondo si LGU.

asr-002384
02:11:26.120 --> 02:11:30.700
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: So that's really a challenge, sir, in quality and also in the sustainability.

asr-002385
02:11:31.200 --> 02:11:31.520
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: Thank you.

asr-002386
02:11:31.680 --> 02:11:32.960
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you very much, ED Carol.

asr-002387
02:11:33.120 --> 02:11:38.040
Senator Joel Villanueva: And just now, I told my staff that we will come up with a committee report

asr-002388
02:11:38.040 --> 02:11:38.960
Senator Joel Villanueva: as soon as possible.

asr-002389
02:11:39.300 --> 02:11:43.060
Senator Joel Villanueva: We'll do our best that before our break,

asr-002390
02:11:43.120 --> 02:11:47.180
Senator Joel Villanueva: we'll be able to sponsor it on the floor, itong LUC governance bill,

asr-002391
02:11:47.440 --> 02:11:48.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: which is very important.

asr-002392
02:11:49.180 --> 02:11:51.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: So tulong-tulong po tayo.

asr-002393
02:11:52.020 --> 02:11:55.500
Senator Joel Villanueva: Mahal natin itong TESDA, lalo na itong TVET.

asr-002394
02:11:56.120 --> 02:11:59.960
Senator Joel Villanueva: Just to move forward, I wanted to finish early.

asr-002395
02:11:59.960 --> 02:12:07.400
Senator Joel Villanueva: And I just can't pass on this particular recommendation of EDCOM,

asr-002396
02:12:07.620 --> 02:12:15.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: yung calling on the overhauling of our program in the scholarship programs of TESDA.

asr-002397
02:12:15.760 --> 02:12:18.960
Senator Joel Villanueva: Let me just give you a personal story.

asr-002398
02:12:20.440 --> 02:12:22.240
Senator Joel Villanueva: Magagalit sa akin yung kaklasi ko dito.

asr-002399
02:12:22.880 --> 02:12:25.900
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kasawa ng kaklasi ko, tumawag sa akin, sabi niya,

asr-002400
02:12:26.120 --> 02:12:32.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: Brad, yung kumari mo na may trabaho naman,

asr-002401
02:12:33.360 --> 02:12:37.400
Senator Joel Villanueva: inaya nung kapitbahay niya na maging scholar ng TESDA,

asr-002402
02:12:37.520 --> 02:12:41.960
Senator Joel Villanueva: tuwang-tuwa kasi may allowance, may...

asr-002403
02:12:42.880 --> 02:12:46.540
Senator Joel Villanueva: And I'm not sure if it's a step or anong program,

asr-002404
02:12:46.760 --> 02:12:49.140
Senator Joel Villanueva: kasi parang tinanong ko na lang,

asr-002405
02:12:49.680 --> 02:12:52.800
Senator Joel Villanueva: nasabi ko, may trabaho naman si Mare,

asr-002406
02:12:53.040 --> 02:12:54.320
Senator Joel Villanueva: ano ba yan, upskilling?

asr-002407
02:12:54.320 --> 02:12:55.060
Senator Joel Villanueva: Hindi, ano eh.

asr-002408
02:12:55.160 --> 02:12:55.320
Senator Joel Villanueva: Baking and...

asr-002409
02:12:56.120 --> 02:12:58.380
Senator Joel Villanueva: food processing, et cetera.

asr-002410
02:12:58.560 --> 02:13:03.740
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, ang point ko lang, dun sa programa na yun,

asr-002411
02:13:03.900 --> 02:13:07.200
Senator Joel Villanueva: parang hindi ko alam bakit siya yung napili.

asr-002412
02:13:07.980 --> 02:13:10.100
Senator Joel Villanueva: Yun yung naging concern ko.

asr-002413
02:13:10.280 --> 02:13:11.000
Senator Joel Villanueva: Bakit ikaw?

asr-002414
02:13:11.200 --> 02:13:14.260
Senator Joel Villanueva: Parang sa dami ng pwedeng mapiling scholar, bakit ikaw?

asr-002415
02:13:14.680 --> 02:13:18.880
Senator Joel Villanueva: And then I came across with the recommendation ng EDCOM

asr-002416
02:13:18.880 --> 02:13:26.060
Senator Joel Villanueva: to calling for an overhaul because of weak targeting, political influence.

asr-002417
02:13:26.120 --> 02:13:28.120
Senator Joel Villanueva: Alam na natin yan, no?

asr-002418
02:13:28.120 --> 02:13:33.580
Senator Joel Villanueva: Fragmented information systems and recurring financial management deficiencies.

asr-002419
02:13:33.720 --> 02:13:35.900
Senator Joel Villanueva: I saw that eh, yung recommendation.

asr-002420
02:13:36.340 --> 02:13:41.340
Senator Joel Villanueva: And for me, gusto kong erase itong budget briefing.

asr-002421
02:13:41.780 --> 02:13:47.880
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kung papaano or how will TESDA implement such a comprehensive,

asr-002422
02:13:47.880 --> 02:13:55.680
Senator Joel Villanueva: time-bound reform of scholarship system, including yung allocation nito, criteria,

asr-002423
02:13:56.120 --> 02:14:01.340
Senator Joel Villanueva: beneficiary safeguards, kasi nung marinig ko yung kaklase ko,

asr-002424
02:14:01.420 --> 02:14:05.700
Senator Joel Villanueva: gusto kong sabihin, pati naman kayo, pati ba naman kayo,

asr-002425
02:14:06.080 --> 02:14:10.040
Senator Joel Villanueva: sumahali pa sa napakadaming nangangailangan, kayo pa yung sasali dyan, no?

asr-002426
02:14:10.860 --> 02:14:14.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: And of course, which is very important to me,

asr-002427
02:14:15.060 --> 02:14:18.580
Senator Joel Villanueva: lagi kong hinahanap, syempre, yung reporting ng employment outcomes.

asr-002428
02:14:18.580 --> 02:14:22.540
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, I hope we can look into this.

asr-002429
02:14:23.220 --> 02:14:25.980
Senator Joel Villanueva: And sabi ko nga po, since the time...

asr-002430
02:14:26.120 --> 02:14:31.320
Senator Joel Villanueva: I joined the Senate, first time akong nag-enjoy sa sekretary ng TESDA.

asr-002431
02:14:31.320 --> 02:14:33.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: I have to say, I was so disappointed in the past.

asr-002432
02:14:34.720 --> 02:14:42.020
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sorry to say that, but I can look anyone in the eyes, in their eyes, and say,

asr-002433
02:14:42.020 --> 02:14:46.100
Senator Joel Villanueva: Benzo, umoo sa akin, mukhang ikaw nag-aagree ka sa akin ah.

asr-002434
02:14:48.100 --> 02:14:53.060
Senator Joel Villanueva: Na natutuwa ako na this time, we can do something, guys.

asr-002435
02:14:53.060 --> 02:14:56.060
Senator Joel Villanueva: We can do something, we can leave a lasting legacy.

asr-002436
02:14:56.120 --> 02:14:58.920
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, I hope we do that, no, ah, sekretary, please.

