02:15:55.200 --> 02:15:55.600
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: through the

asr-002444
02:15:55.680 --> 02:16:17.440
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: skills passport para digital lahat and it is transparent and so on. Wala na po kaming naisip na solusyon sa tinawag po ninyong political influence in the selection process. So we are awaiting for the common social registry that the DSWD is putting together.

asr-002445
02:16:17.440 --> 02:16:22.640
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: we are hoping that they are finished by december which is what they had told us as their target

asr-002446
02:16:22.640 --> 02:16:25.040
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: so we can roll out the interoperability

asr-002447
02:16:25.680 --> 02:16:33.200
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: um of demographic data that dswd actually has now with the as well as with their community-based

asr-002448
02:16:34.160 --> 02:16:39.440
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: monitoring system which they need to also clean up right so they need to be able to find ways

asr-002449
02:16:39.440 --> 02:16:47.680
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: to validate that with PSA, with any other data sources. We're working with DICT and DSWD

asr-002450
02:16:47.680 --> 02:16:55.520
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: to complete that that cycle as well as psa as i said to make sure that our targeting is a little

asr-002451
02:16:55.680 --> 02:17:07.760
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: bit better and no longer dependent on the old system that we have, which is twofold. Kaya confusing kanina yung tanong ninyo tungkol sa TTSP, dahil ang amin pong

asr-002452
02:17:07.760 --> 02:17:14.400
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: basis is self-identification. So at pangalawa,

asr-002453
02:17:15.280 --> 02:17:24.800
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: depende po sa certification ni kapitan, right? So we need to find ways to cross-triangulate that information so that it is

asr-002454
02:17:25.680 --> 02:17:32.320
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: not just dependent on both self-identification and/or the certification ni kapitan that they are

asr-002455
02:17:33.440 --> 02:17:38.720
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: neat and so on and so forth so it's easier if they're already employed because the employer

asr-002456
02:17:38.720 --> 02:17:44.240
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: helps us but if they are not it becomes a little bit more difficult so we're trying to fix that

