02:28:14.340 --> 02:28:17.140
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Secretary Benitez

asr-002675
02:28:17.140 --> 02:28:18.620
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: and the Testa family

asr-002676
02:28:18.620 --> 02:28:20.100
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: to this budget hearing.

asr-002677
02:28:20.100 --> 02:28:23.760
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Umpisahan ko lang po doon sa

asr-002678
02:28:23.760 --> 02:28:27.240
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: 2026 budget.

asr-002679
02:28:27.420 --> 02:28:29.720
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: We allocated about 1.6 billion

asr-002680
02:28:29.720 --> 02:28:32.100
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: for AI upskilling,

asr-002681
02:28:32.980 --> 02:28:34.680
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: semiconductors, and healthcare.

asr-002682
02:28:35.600 --> 02:28:37.760
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And natanong ko ito dahil

asr-002683
02:28:37.760 --> 02:28:38.900
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I'm sure you know,

asr-002684
02:28:39.140 --> 02:28:42.200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: these past few days,

asr-002685
02:28:43.280 --> 02:28:44.840
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: malaki pong issue itong

asr-002686
02:28:44.840 --> 02:28:46.460
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: artificial intelligence

asr-002687
02:28:46.460 --> 02:28:49.300
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: and how it can wipe out humanity.

asr-002688
02:28:49.300 --> 02:28:49.980
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: No?

asr-002689
02:28:50.100 --> 02:28:51.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pero tingin ko,

asr-002690
02:28:52.600 --> 02:28:53.780
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: ewan ko kung buhay pa tayo

asr-002691
02:28:53.780 --> 02:28:54.820
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: ng sekretary o hindi.

asr-002692
02:28:55.380 --> 02:28:59.080
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But my track is

asr-002693
02:28:59.080 --> 02:29:02.560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: definitely AI will disrupt

asr-002694
02:29:02.560 --> 02:29:04.160
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: many of our industries,

asr-002695
02:29:04.520 --> 02:29:07.440
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: specifically the business process outsourcing.

asr-002696
02:29:08.280 --> 02:29:10.280
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So I just want to get an update

asr-002697
02:29:10.280 --> 02:29:12.220
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: dito sa 1.8 billion

asr-002698
02:29:12.220 --> 02:29:14.080
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: sa TWSP

asr-002699
02:29:14.080 --> 02:29:16.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: and then ilan yung ating mga

asr-002700
02:29:16.340 --> 02:29:18.880
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: na-upskill

asr-002701
02:29:18.880 --> 02:29:19.820
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: na mga batas,

asr-002702
02:29:19.820 --> 02:29:20.080
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: na mga batas,

asr-002703
02:29:20.100 --> 02:29:22.100
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: on AI, semiconductors,

asr-002704
02:29:22.860 --> 02:29:23.500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: and healthcare.

asr-002705
