asr-003443
03:00:20.540 --> 03:00:35.440
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Yes, sir. Because at the moment, most of the demand for EBET has been in upskilling. Dito po nang gagaling ang tinitraining namin for the BPO industry for upskilling. Because they are employees that are looking for upskilling, if you remember.

asr-003444
03:00:35.440 --> 03:00:46.440
Senator Joel Villanueva: Yes, yes, yes. I'm aware of that. It's just that for me, I think it should not be the only funding na pwede nating pagkuhanan.

asr-003445
