Senator Joel Villanueva: And in fact, I would suggest that we...

asr-003446
03:00:50.540 --> 03:01:12.700
Senator Joel Villanueva: We separate the SP from EBET. Para yung concerns ni SP, which I also agree. Sayang yung opportunity and we can focus on enterprise base in such a way that we'll be able to figure out how else we can work on it, improve.

asr-003447
03:01:12.700 --> 03:01:19.700
Senator Joel Villanueva: And looking at the historical background of the financial program.

asr-003448
03:01:20.540 --> 03:01:27.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: I think that in terms of TTSP, hindi naman nag-grow ng malaki eh. So kung doon lang yung universe mo eh, from...

asr-003449
