Senator Joel Villanueva: And Secretary, meron bang... Kasi merong... I think it's also the number of enterprises that join. So I remember talking to you about this na I think one of the parang concern or one of the complication,

asr-003458
03:02:20.540 --> 03:02:31.160
Senator Joel Villanueva: there's a... At least dun sa na-experience ko, kailangan pa i-amend ng corporation ng kanilang Articles of Incorporation.

asr-003459
03:02:31.880 --> 03:02:47.480
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, syempre sa kanila, parang hassle pa. Tapos, of course, kukuha ka pa ng abogado. So may mga ganun na maliliit na bagay. And also the claiming of incentives. I think this was also raised by EDCOM.

asr-003460
03:02:47.480 --> 03:02:49.480
Senator Joel Villanueva: So may mga ganitong...

asr-003461
03:02:50.540 --> 03:03:04.880
