TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: We are hoping to comply with the EBET provisions on a digital one-stop shop by the fourth quarter, sir, of this year. So we're hoping that many of those little issues in terms of implementation...

asr-003465
03:03:49.880 --> 03:04:07.760
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: can be overcome before we launch the digital one-stop shop. I am assuming that even after we do so, may lalabas pa rin po yan na mahirap na kailangan ding palitan ng TESDA in terms of its internal rules and guidelines.

asr-003466
03:04:07.760 --> 03:04:18.760
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: But yes, sir, we understand that these are parts of the problem because the law, again, of Senator Joel...

asr-003467
