TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: It's TVI's from registering. So the enterprise has to take the lead in terms of its registration. And many of those enterprises actually are reluctant to create training plans and so on, would rather partner up as that kind of dual training system with an institution.

asr-003468
03:04:40.380 --> 03:04:49.760
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: But the institution cannot, in fact, like they used to before the institution could register and partner up with an enterprise for the...

asr-003469
03:04:49.880 --> 03:05:07.420
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: enterprise-based portion. Ngayon po, baliktad. And the TVI institution, the TECVOC institution cannot be the one to register, even if they are on behalf of the enterprise, right?

asr-003470
03:05:07.420 --> 03:05:13.080
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Kung kahit na-partner sila, which is another one of those hurdles. But it is, sir, it's in the law.

asr-003471
03:05:14.460 --> 03:05:16.740
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kung ngayon, yung enterprise, they need to partner.

asr-003472
03:05:18.200 --> 03:05:19.480
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Not necessarily, sir.

asr-003473
03:05:19.880 --> 03:05:23.860
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: But in many ways, that's probably the...

asr-003474
