asr-003485
03:06:13.660 --> 03:06:15.740
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Or have the size and scale.

asr-003486
03:06:17.620 --> 03:06:18.800
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Nasa batas nyo rin po yan.

asr-003487
