Senator Joel Villanueva: Yes, I was just...

asr-003488
03:06:19.720 --> 03:06:24.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: Just given the, you know, yung three points that still pending, no?

asr-003489
03:06:24.720 --> 03:06:32.680
Senator Joel Villanueva: Itong eBET support integrators, itong eBET one-stop shop, and itong eBET grievance mechanism still pending.

asr-003490
