TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Ang eBET grievance mechanism, sir, internal to the enterprises, we require them to have one.

asr-003491
03:06:40.660 --> 03:06:42.120
Senator Joel Villanueva: There's no guidelines pa, e.

asr-003492
