Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Those mga maliliit na bagay lang, no?

asr-003504
03:07:09.000 --> 03:07:11.900
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: These are things that we might have overlooked.

asr-003505
03:07:12.900 --> 03:07:17.840
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pero nakaka-ano siya, nakaka-discouraged ng participants, no?

asr-003506
03:07:17.840 --> 03:07:18.880
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Especially for eBET.

asr-003507
03:07:19.420 --> 03:07:24.620
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But this, in eBET is particularly, lahat naman tayo sinusuportahan ito, no?

asr-003508
03:07:24.620 --> 03:07:25.900
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Because we all know the outcome.

asr-003509
03:07:26.540 --> 03:07:29.400
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, maraming salamat, Mr. Chairman.

asr-003510
03:07:29.520 --> 03:07:31.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you for the opportunity.

asr-003511
03:07:31.520 --> 03:07:36.060
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Mr. Chairman, I keep on saying your law, pero principal authors...

asr-003512
