asr-003516
03:08:02.400 --> 03:08:11.980
Senator Joel Villanueva: because he knows very well how TESDA works, how everything works from the little things

asr-003517
03:08:11.980 --> 03:08:16.180
Senator Joel Villanueva: and all these scholarship programs na very confusing sometimes.

asr-003518
03:08:17.020 --> 03:08:17.380
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you.

asr-003519
03:08:17.380 --> 03:08:17.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you.

