TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: at hindi pa po lumalabas ang master plan ng PQF National Coordinating Council.

asr-003537
03:09:45.860 --> 03:09:51.400
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: And in the absence of that, in terms of targeting lifelong learning efforts per se,

asr-003538
03:09:51.400 --> 03:10:04.680
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: what we have been doing has been using our current budgets for things like creative industries, right?

asr-003539
03:10:04.760 --> 03:10:12.560
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: For things that may not look like they are directly related to employment per se,

asr-003540
03:10:13.080 --> 03:10:15.740
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: but might be for culture, for heritage.

asr-003541
03:10:15.860 --> 03:10:17.680
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: So on and so forth.

asr-003542
03:10:18.180 --> 03:10:23.140
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: All of that, sir, is going to be part of the lifelong learning rollout, particularly for LGUs,

asr-003543
03:10:23.240 --> 03:10:30.580
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: which is also, after all, part of the proposal to get DILG to spearhead its implementation.

asr-003544
03:10:31.280 --> 03:10:35.300
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: So sa ngayon, sir, yun pa lang ang aming mga nilalagay or ginagawa.

asr-003545
03:10:35.820 --> 03:10:40.880
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Wala pa pong identified line item that says this is lifelong learning.

asr-003546
03:10:40.880 --> 03:10:45.680
Senator Joel Villanueva: I was about to say that.

asr-003547
03:10:45.860 --> 03:10:54.720
Senator Joel Villanueva: I'm happy to note that the Secretary of TESDA is now the chairperson of the PQF National Referencing Committee.

asr-003548
03:10:55.260 --> 03:10:59.780
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Sir, referencing committee po kami, hindi po kami sa lifelong learning.

asr-003549
03:10:59.980 --> 03:11:05.680
Senator Joel Villanueva: Yeah, but considering that you are there, nasa kanila yung bola, at least maano natin yan.

asr-003550
03:11:05.680 --> 03:11:15.740
Senator Joel Villanueva: And of course, that brings me to my next point, how much allocated for 2026 and for 2027.

asr-003551
03:11:15.860 --> 03:11:25.740
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kasi laki nung responsibility na binibigay sa TESDA's work under the Philippine Qualifications Framework

asr-003552
03:11:25.740 --> 03:11:28.460
Senator Joel Villanueva: and the National Referencing Committee.

asr-003553
03:11:29.420 --> 03:11:34.180
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Sir, ang budget po niyan nasa DepEd. Wala po sa TESDA.

asr-003554
03:11:35.460 --> 03:11:36.320
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ano? Allocation?

asr-003555
03:11:36.600 --> 03:11:40.500
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Wala po. Walang specific po for the PQF work.

asr-003556
03:11:40.500 --> 03:11:45.100
Senator Joel Villanueva: What's your view on that?

asr-003557
03:11:45.100 --> 03:11:45.700
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: At the moment?

asr-003558
03:11:45.860 --> 03:11:47.660
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Sir, there is still actually…

asr-003559
03:11:47.660 --> 03:11:48.960
Senator Joel Villanueva: We can get a line item for that?

asr-003560
03:11:49.200 --> 03:11:53.280
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Pwede naman, sir. Kaya lang. Sa totoo lang, may unused pa po sa DepEd eh.

asr-003561
03:11:53.780 --> 03:11:57.200
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: The budget is actually at DepEd and they haven't actually used it yet.

asr-003562
03:11:58.220 --> 03:11:59.880
Senator Joel Villanueva: So ililipat na lang namin, sir.

asr-003563
03:11:59.900 --> 03:12:02.240
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Pero sila po ang chair ng PQF Council.

asr-003564
03:12:02.240 --> 03:12:04.480
Senator Joel Villanueva: I know, I know. I'm just kidding.

asr-003565
03:12:04.960 --> 03:12:11.560
Senator Joel Villanueva: At saka si Senator Angare is more than capable of bringing reforms.

asr-003566
03:12:13.000 --> 03:12:15.240
Senator Joel Villanueva: Anyway, when we test the complete…

asr-003567
03:12:15.240 --> 03:12:26.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: We can submit itong Philippines Updated AQRF, yung re-referencing report to the ASEAN Qualifications Referencing Framework Committee.

asr-003568
03:12:26.820 --> 03:12:34.900
Senator Joel Villanueva: And perhaps the next question would be what remaining steps must be completed before the endorsement and the publication ito?

asr-003569
03:12:35.200 --> 03:12:38.740
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Sir, it's ongoing and there is in fact…

asr-003570
03:12:38.740 --> 03:12:40.320
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Actually, Rose, ikaw kaya sumagot.

asr-003571
03:12:40.720 --> 03:12:43.240
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ikaw kaya mag-attend sa meeting.

asr-003572
03:12:44.040 --> 03:12:45.080
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ikaw nga ang sumagot.

asr-003576
03:12:47.700 --> 03:12:51.260
Senator Joel Villanueva: Namimiss ka na rin, namimiss na rin ni SPWin yung boses mo.

asr-003577
03:12:53.320 --> 03:13:00.660
TESDA Deputy Director General Rosanna Urdaneta: The last AQRF was held in Bangkok, Thailand a month ago.

asr-003578
03:13:01.260 --> 03:13:09.440
TESDA Deputy Director General Rosanna Urdaneta: And we have promised that we have committed that we shall submit the updated report on December.

asr-003579
03:13:10.160 --> 03:13:11.220
TESDA Deputy Director General Rosanna Urdaneta: of this year.

asr-003580
03:13:11.280 --> 03:13:11.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: This year.

asr-003581
03:13:11.820 --> 03:13:12.080
Senator Joel Villanueva: Okay.

asr-003582
03:13:12.080 --> 03:13:14.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: Okay.

asr-003583
03:13:15.220 --> 03:13:15.740
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sige.

asr-003584
03:13:16.280 --> 03:13:18.100
Senator Joel Villanueva: We'll look forward to it.

asr-003585
03:13:18.540 --> 03:13:19.120
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you.

asr-003586
03:13:19.240 --> 03:13:22.100
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Sorry, Mr. Chair, if I may line just to be even more specific.

asr-003587
03:13:23.060 --> 03:13:38.080
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: The request of the ASEAN Qualifications Referencing Framework has been for us to do an update of our report rather than to re-reference because of the number of reforms, no?

asr-003588
03:13:38.080 --> 03:13:41.080
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: That we have undertaken that was not part of the original…

asr-003589
03:13:42.080 --> 03:13:43.080
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Re-referencing.

asr-003590
03:13:43.080 --> 03:13:54.680
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: So, at this point, what the committee is doing is, in fact, updating the original referencing report to include the new level descriptors and so on and so forth.

asr-003591
03:13:54.680 --> 03:13:58.700
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: And the timeline is supposed to be by December this year.

asr-003592
03:13:59.720 --> 03:14:00.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you.

asr-003593
03:14:00.680 --> 03:14:01.780
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you very much.

asr-003594
03:14:01.780 --> 03:14:11.740
Senator Joel Villanueva: Unless our Senate President or anyone would like to, perhaps, I don't want to preempt the Senate President's motion.

asr-003595
03:14:12.080 --> 03:14:19.980
Senator Joel Villanueva: To deem the, I mean, to submit for plenary consideration the…

asr-003596
03:14:19.980 --> 03:14:27.400
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Mr. Chairman, it's a pleasure to submit the budget of TESDA to plenary for further discussions and approval.

asr-003597
03:14:28.140 --> 03:14:35.560
Senator Joel Villanueva: There is a motion rendered no other than the Senate President of the Republic of the Philippines.

asr-003598
03:14:36.220 --> 03:14:38.060
Senator Joel Villanueva: How can we object to that?

asr-003599
03:14:38.400 --> 03:14:40.840
Senator Joel Villanueva: And hearing no objection, the motion is carried.

asr-003600
03:14:41.480 --> 03:14:41.600
Senator Joel Villanueva: And so…

asr-003601
03:14:42.080 --> 03:14:57.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, we, the fiscal year 2027 proposed budget of the TESDA is now hereby submitted for plenary consideration subject to the discussions and submission of requested documents by our colleagues.

asr-003602
03:14:57.320 --> 03:14:59.720
Senator Joel Villanueva: Maraming salamat po to everyone.

asr-003603
03:15:00.000 --> 03:15:12.460
Senator Joel Villanueva: Again, I'd like to take this opportunity to thank our Senate President, the hardworking Senate President who keeps on pushing us to work in the wee hours of the morning.

asr-003604
03:15:13.980 --> 03:15:26.300
Senator Joel Villanueva: And I think most of my time spent here in the Senate, I think at least 70% of my day spent here in the Senate or 80% of my day.

asr-003605
03:15:26.380 --> 03:15:29.100
Senator Joel Villanueva: But we're happy to work with our Senate President.

asr-003606
03:15:29.100 --> 03:15:47.540
Senator Joel Villanueva: Of course, thank you, Secretary Kiko Benitez, DDG Galo, DDG Urdaneta, DDG Vidal, DDG Allan, and Directors, Provincial Directors, Regional Directors, Executive Directors, of course, our friends from COA.

asr-003607
03:15:47.720 --> 03:15:49.340
Senator Joel Villanueva: Maraming salamat po sa inyong lahat.

asr-003608
03:15:49.860 --> 03:15:55.620
Senator Joel Villanueva: This budget briefing is hereby suspended. Maraming salamat po sa inyo and may God bless us all. Salamat po.

